    "summary": "Use it in the opponent's Movement phase, as an enemy unit that is **engaged** with a **SWORD BRETHREN SQUAD** unit of yours is picked for a **fall-back move**, and choose your **SWORD BRETHREN SQUAD** unit.\n\nFor the rest of the phase, each enemy unit engaged with it that is picked for a fall-back move, the first one included:\n\n- has to fall back in **desperate escape** mode\n- takes -1 on its **hazard rolls** for that move if it is **battle-shocked**",
